  "messages": [
    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the retail price of one pack of glue sticks at the school-supply store? Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 28 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. The only information given is that Mr. Jackson’s class has 28 students.  \n2. No price, quantity, or cost information about the glue sticks is provided.  \n3. Therefore, the retail price of one pack cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information given.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Wait, I made a mistake. Mr. Jackson’s fourth-grade class has 27 students.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Even with 27 students, no information is provided about the cost of the glue sticks. Therefore, the retail price cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined from the information given}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: the glue sticks come in packs of 9.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The class has 27 students, and each pack contains 9 glue sticks:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 9 = 3 \\text{ packs}\n\\]\n\nSo the class would need 3 packs, but the price of each pack is not given. Therefore:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information given.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. The glue sticks come in packs of 8.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "With 27 students and 8 glue sticks per pack:\n\n\\[\n27 \\div 8 = 3\\text{ remainder }3\n\\]\n\nSo the class would need 4 packs. However, the price per pack is not provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The retail price cannot be determined from the information given.}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: the school-supply store sells each pack of glue sticks for $6.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "The store sells each pack of glue sticks for **$6**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Here's another detail: the store does not offer discounts on glue-stick packs.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Since the store does not offer discounts, the retail price remains:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\$6}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Thanks, that helps. Now I want to figure out: How many packs of glue sticks does Mr. Jackson need to buy so every student can have 2 glue sticks? By the way, here are some relevant details: Mr. Jackson wants to give each student 2 glue sticks. Mr. Jackson can only buy whole packs and expects to have some extra glue sticks left over.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "1. Mr. Jackson needs \\(27 \\times 2 = 54\\) glue sticks.\n2. Each pack contains 8 glue sticks.\n3. Divide:\n\n\\[\n54 \\div 8 = 6.75\n\\]\n\nSince he can only buy whole packs, he must round up to 7 packs.\n\n\\[\n7 \\times 8 = 56\n\\]\n\nThere will be \\(56-54=2\\) glue sticks left over.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{7\\text{ packs}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
